# System Architecture

Version: 1.0 (MVP)

Status: Planning

---

# Overview

This system is an AI-powered Front Office platform designed for real estate agencies.

The platform automates customer communication, lead qualification, appointment scheduling, and property inquiries while seamlessly handing qualified leads to human agents.

The system is designed to be white-label, allowing each agency to customize its branding, colors, logo, knowledge base, and property listings.

---

# System Objectives

The platform should:

- Respond to customer inquiries instantly.
- Capture every lead.
- Qualify potential buyers and renters.
- Schedule property viewings.
- Answer frequently asked questions.
- Notify agents of qualified leads.
- Reduce repetitive administrative work.
- Improve customer experience.

