# System Components

## Customer Interface

Purpose

Provides customers with an easy way to communicate with the agency.

Functions

- Start conversations
- Ask questions
- Search for properties
- Schedule viewings
- Request human assistance

---

## AI Engine

Purpose

Acts as the virtual front office assistant.

Responsibilities

- Understand customer intent.
- Answer customer questions.
- Collect customer information.
- Qualify leads.
- Recommend properties.
- Book appointments.
- Escalate conversations when necessary.

---

## Backend Server

Purpose

Coordinates communication between all platform components.

Responsibilities

- Authentication
- Business logic
- Property search
- Lead management
- Appointment scheduling
- Notification handling
- Data validation

---

## Knowledge Base

Purpose

Provides verified business information to the AI.

Contains

- Company FAQs
- Office hours
- Buying guides
- Selling guides
- Rental guides
- Policies
- Agent information

---

## Property Database

Stores

- Property listings
- Prices
- Images
- Locations
- Availability
- Property descriptions
- Assigned agents

---

## Lead Database

Stores

- Customer name
- Phone number
- Email address
- Budget
- Preferred location
- Property type
- Timeline
- Financing preference
- Lead score
- Conversation history

---

## Appointment System

Responsibilities

- Schedule property viewings
- Manage availability
- Reschedule appointments
- Send confirmations
- Send reminders

---

## Notification Service

Purpose

Notify staff whenever customer action is required.

Notifications include

- New lead
- Viewing booked
- Customer requesting an agent
- Customer follow-up reminder

Notification channels

- Email
- SMS (future)
- WhatsApp (future)
- Mobile notifications (future)

---

## Agent Dashboard

Agents should be able to

- View new leads
- Review conversations
- View scheduled appointments
- Manage property listings
- Update lead status
- Contact customers

---

## Admin Dashboard

Administrators should be able to

- Manage agents
- Manage properties
- Upload knowledge base documents
- View analytics
- Configure branding
- Configure AI settings
- View conversation logs

